sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as User Admin
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>UsersPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>CreatePlatformManagerBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>CreatePlatformManagerController
  participant User as «entity»<br/>User
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: create Platform Management accounts
  UI->>B: POST /api/admin/users (JWT)
  B->>C: create(Integer adminId, CreateManagerRequest request)
  alt email already used
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 409 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>User: emailTaken()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C->>User: save()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C-->>B: AdminUserResponse
  B-->>UI: 201 Created JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end